{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-housing-benefit-calculator UI copy.example","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-housing-benefit-calculator.copy.example","keys":["norway-housing-benefit-calculator.copy.example"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Voor een huishoudenslid zonder inkomen en met maandelijkse goedgekeurde huisvestingskosten van NOK ZXQPH0000QXZ bedraagt de standaard eigen bijdrage van NOK ZXQPH0001QXZ ongeveer NOK ZXQPH0002QXZ per maand.De geschatte uitkering bedraagt ongeveer NOK ZXQPH0003QXZ na toepassing van het tarief ZXQPH0004QXZ.","record_id":"806e67c482ce996c15f7dc864e6d1292fb7f352bc1fc1b42c93d3d8d721e0070","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":3.0059823804999724,"source":"For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"fc590096df873c97626ee892fa18ee9e1357f24aba8264e31c25190d4cecaae5","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Voor een huishoudenslid zonder inkomen en met maandelijkse goedgekeurde huisvestingskosten van NOK 8,000 bedraagt de standaard eigen bijdrage van NOK 2026 ongeveer NOK 2,215 per maand.De geschatte uitkering bedraagt ongeveer NOK 4,032 na toepassing van het tarief 73.7%.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
